cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the archived
  release. If you refer to the method itself, please cite the
  accompanying article.
title: "DMS-SI-Mix: Reproducibility Package"
version: 1.0.0
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the two-space scale-invariant Direct
  Multisearch method DMS-SI-Mix. Version 1.0.0 contains the data,
  configurations, run logs, final archives, metric tables, and
  validation scripts supporting the reported experiments, including
  the MORAP-NM exact Pareto front with integrity hashes and the
  categorical-neighborhood ablation. It does NOT yet contain the
  MATLAB solver, which is added in version 1.1.0.
authors:
  - family-names: Madeira
    given-names: J. F. A.
    email: aguilarmadeira@tecnico.ulisboa.pt
    affiliation: >-
      IDMEC-IST, Instituto Superior Tecnico, Universidade de Lisboa,
      Portugal; ISEL-IPL, Lisboa, Portugal
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9523-3808"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - derivative-free optimization
  - multiobjective optimization
  - direct multisearch
  - mixed-variable optimization
  - scale invariance
  - categorical variables
  - deterministic neighborhood rotation
  - reproducibility
